	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d10r0201_swrival_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>[Name:TrainerName Idx="1" ]『チョット　まってな▼
むかしの　なかまを　きずつけないよう
せっとく　するんだってさ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-09T12:53:33" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-09T12:15:05" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>[Name:TrainerName Idx="1" ]『チョット　待ってな▼
昔の　仲間を　傷つけないよう
説得するんだってさ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-09T12:53:51" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-09T12:15:05" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・posイベント
　GRIDX＝、GRIDZ＝
・続けてsage6_01</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-09T12:42:24" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWRIVAL
ライバル</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-09T12:15:05" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#404040</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
