	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d10r0201_swrival_05"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>[Name:TrainerName Idx="1" ]『ああ　じょうとう　だね▼
オレは　うばわれた　ポケモンを
とりもどすため　たたかっている▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-09T12:33:26" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-09T12:17:30" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>[Name:TrainerName Idx="1" ]『ああ　上等だね▼
オレは　奪われた　ポケモンを
取り戻すため　戦っている▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-09T12:56:44" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-09T12:17:30" />
		</LanguageCell>
